{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309590","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309590","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130959001:1":{"text":"ハハハ、それは興味深いな。ある意味、私たちは宝探しに来たわけだしね。","source_cn":"哈哈，这说法有意思。从某种意义上讲，我们的确是来寻宝的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3360B0C6E6A1F353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130959002:1":{"text":"でも、我々が探しているものは、他の人とはまったく異なる。神秘的な魅力に包まれた失われた歴史。それこそが、我々にとっての財宝なのだ！","source_cn":"不过我们想找的宝藏和其他人不一样。那些神秘又迷人的失落...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92E7A82D56AC500E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130959003:1":{"text":"できれば今回の調査で残陽神に関する論文を完成させられればベストだ！","source_cn":"真希望这次能找到点什么，最好能让我们完成一篇关于残阳神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27D5570859B08179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:学者朱利安":{"text":"学者のジュリアン","source":"学者朱利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}